<title>CANADA: Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data - Nov 1.</title>
<headline>Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data - Nov 1.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Oilseed Processors Association weekly summary of member crushing, in tonnes -</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING	  CANOLA    SOYBEANS</p>
<p>October 30	   50,213    31,928</p>
<p>change prv week    +7.7 pct  +14.3 pct</p>
<p>October 23	   46,604    27,942</p>
<p>October 16	   56,398    32,349</p>
<p>October 9	    64,489    25,462</p>
<p>August 1 to date  749,755   277,949</p>
<p>-- Note: COPA consists of Archer Daniels Midland Co, CanAmera Foods, Canbra Foods Ltd and Northern Lite Canola Inc with crush data also provided by Cargill Ltd, the Canadian unit of Minnesota-based Cargill Inc.</p>
<p>(Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548)</p>
